    <string name="info_help_4">IZiko loQhagamshelwano leKomishoni yoNyulo: 0800 11 8000 (simahla, 7am – 9pm phakathi evekini).</string>
    <string name="info_privacy_1">Siqokelela inombolo yesazisi sakho, ifoto yesazisi, ukuskena ubuso, idilesi nenombolo yeselfowuni kuphela ukuze sikubhalise kwaye siqinisekise ukuba nguwe.</string>
